                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RESOLVE-MANAGED-FUND-0199.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       COMPUTE-SUM-ASSURED-0200.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
